    "lines": [
      "For your convenience, PristonTale supports hot keys ",
      "for you to use potion. There are 3 types of potion such as VF,",
      "STM, and MP. Simply locate potion at the mini ",
      "inventory at the bottom of your screen. You can use ",
      "potion by pressing number key 1 to 3. The amount you can ",
      "carry will depend upon what type of armlet you wear.",
